pic": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/65806718619a95e2b98cd740f3555548a6700d1d.jpg", "title": "回马枪来了：江浙沪皖将出现二茬雨，山河四省后东北将暴雨", "pubdate": 1786462064, "ctime": 1786462064, "desc": "8月11日，白海豚的本体主力雨带已经进入河南、湖北。在白海豚本体雨带影响下，河南黄河以南、湖北西北部出现大范围的暴雨到大暴雨，驻马店局部雨量已经达到特大暴雨量级。而在白海豚外围水汽输送和冷空气作用下，北京、内蒙古也出现散装暴雨，其中北京顺义、延庆局部雨势非常猛烈，顺义后沙峪1小时雨量88.5毫米，达到了短时特大暴雨标准。\n然而在北方暴雨开始的同时，江浙沪的暴雨并没有立即消失。8月11日浙江东部的舟山、宁海、大陈岛、温州等地再次出现猛烈暴雨，局部雨量达到大暴雨量级，上海、江苏虽然没有大暴雨，但阵雨仍然非常频", "state": 0, "duration": 204, "mission_id": 4067021, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 1, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 547072854, "name": "中气爱", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/e5f6be30a18988ed92f677e6a47a346270172081.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117077553782059, "view": 363767, "danmaku": 1212, "reply": 2695, "favorite": 1153, "coin": 730, "share": 1995, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 0, "like": 19100, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 363767, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 0}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 40819951372, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV1WbuB6gEo5", "first_frame": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00002ihdls6ehpnzv2r93srqb325zzb_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "江苏", "cover43": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8b32033b3175b8677579e56401253dc7bef8f927.jpg", "tidv2": 2207, "tnamev2": "随拍·综合", "pid_v2": 1032, "pid_name_v2": "其他", "attribute_v3": 4, "bvid": "BV1WbuB6gEo5", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 117076010273096, "videos": 1, "tid": 85, "tname": "小剧场", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/35d50c7478cbb3378d24289a10a30831d4ef4c9d.jpg", "title": "勇闯互联网", "pubdate": 1786438577, "ctime": 1786438578, "desc": "-", "state": 0, "duration": 286, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "mo